{"id":"n6715e974c0","headline":"Snowy hydro 2.0 transforms into $42 billion sinkhole","summary":"The Snowy Hydro 2.0 pumped-hydro scheme's cost has risen from an initial $2 billion to $12 billion, and Snowy Hydro confirmed in October 2025 that costs would exceed that. The report puts the total at $42 billion.","why":"Snowy Hydro is a government-owned Australian energy generator, and large public infrastructure cost overruns affect taxpayers and electricity supply planning.","category":"economy","event_type":"capital","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Sydney","country":"Australia","lat":-33.869,"lon":151.209,"region":"oc"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"MacroBusiness","url":"https://www.macrobusiness.com.au/2026/04/snowy-hydro-2-0-transforms-into-42-billion-sinkhole/"},"sources":[{"name":"MacroBusiness","url":"https://www.macrobusiness.com.au/2026/04/snowy-hydro-2-0-transforms-into-42-billion-sinkhole/"}],"published_at":"2026-04-27T02:00:56Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"0cc0c54928e55bc7","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-04-27T02:00:56Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-04-27T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/hydroelectric-dam-2107950.jpg","alt":"hydroelectric dam (illustration)","credit":"egorshitikov","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/hoover-dam-nevada-hoover-dam-power-2107950/"}}